: "1288823873335275", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_1288823876668608_7315186734320478796_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ys9gBEf9bZgQ7kNvwHANtfh&_nc_oc=Adqzpe-7EpCuB-OCPWO_DEh3WuPhXEgnaj-Cthwlqi20Sx41FT4lZFzA8RFDp-KIeXc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR_xmZVdVsthid0_R4Tye6ChVlArdSLabLgPYJpuK11kA&oe=6AF32D9E"}, {"file_name": "drone.png", "id": "1411326580454568", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_1411326583787901_259392697727335925_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7KUJdgyJuZkQ7kNvwE8UeHb&_nc_oc=Adr57UPGbgy4jpzjSnWPP5BjE7RzvHY22sC6ueXcjr5uC47SLYAGkUAB6Of5G9SvgH0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSbdC8du8w2WQ7eTHMIrg7h_M1UbSlY9lL00rzPTxKrTQ&oe=6AF33E08"}, {"file_name": "03-drone.png", "id": "1121162887038149", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_1121162890371482_627965489001917767_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jBWvfd-jCWUQ7kNvwEQkg04&_nc_oc=AdplthT-6M8-by6k9dCRLhinguiJHnyb3UqtRDQyKiOk4si3c-TAnkMRR7ihhogXzGc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQd50CuInjq2OyyZgqC5oUZsFg7ZtXrxOqu8CmJEUzR2A&oe=6AF3553F"}, {"file_name": "music.png", "id": "1408075908196869", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823901_1408075911530202_1159118721049635726_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c8DCW9xZucoQ7kNvwEN968y&_nc_oc=AdqFWD1nI0GhnDwAWqjD0pPdOTawUyNDi8BWaMlDtQ711F-7U9PFeKUsVOGNyxB-DtU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSf7a_s4AbvWidZXRi1oHXzzQ38BohIyGSxqIpaLlQoCQ&oe=6AF3309F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover-landscape-2560x1440.png", "id": "862436103548104", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823949_862436110214770_3337487070693349078_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jUj0HZ0pmpMQ7kNvwGcNWN9&_nc_oc=AdoAM9MLa8PjmzTTOpYeRZQDRkNkz9vvQIhg7_oigz2xN63fn5CsNrlCmwf8t-aygZs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSKyVl_ltScmn4SseRCkd3VYM05yL5p1i_YvpgIoKtPJQ&oe=6AF3520C"}, "display_name": "Eyeline", "keywords": ["amblyopia", "lazyeye", "eyes", "vision"], "long_description": "Eyeline is five arcade games built on one idea: your left and right eyes don't see the same thing. The arrow on an orb, a drone's bolt or half of a Pong court may be shown to only one eye. Choose which eye leads, or play with both equal, and most games adapt to you as you play.\n\nORB SLICER\nA blade in each hand. Orbs fly in on the beat; cut each with the blade of its colour, the way its arrow points. Five tracks, from Warm-up to Storm, and four songs.\n\nDRONE DEFLECT\nA drone circles you and fires. Block its bolts, send them back and bring it down. Five drones, each tougher than the last.\n\nGHOSTBALL\nBrick-breaking Pong across a glowing seam, each half of the court shown to one eye.\n\nDUET PONG\nA paddle in each hand and a rally between them. Keep the ball alive and build the music with every return.\n\nTARGET PRACTICE\nA shooting gallery, one eye at a time. Hit fast and close for the top score.\n\n- Neon stages that move to the music\n- Up to nine players per headset, each with their own scores\n- Leaderboards after every round\n- Play standing or seated\n- Pause anytime with the menu button\n\nHEALTH & SAFETY: This game uses flashing lights, bright colours and fast motion. If you or anyone in your family has had a seizure, a blackout or epilepsy, talk to a doctor before playing. Take regular breaks. Stop and rest if you feel dizzy or sick, get a headache or eye strain, or see double.\n\nEyeline is a game for entertainment, not a medical device; it does not diagnose or treat any condition.", "short_description": "Five neon arcade games where each eye sees something the other doesn't. Slice orbs to the beat, knock a drone's bolts back at it, and rally with a paddle in each hand."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sharkear.com/eyeline/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://sharkear.com/eyeline/terms", "publisher_name": "Sharkear", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sharkear.com/eyeline", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1318317611370006"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2299687284198880"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2299687284198880"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1791218940, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2299687284198880"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1333270583208042", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "2193333718062582", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1318317608036673", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1333270583208042"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2193333718062582"}]}, "change_log": null, "cr